{"seq":35,"slug":"infrastructure-testing","title":"基础设施测试","stage":"DONE","category":"cloud-infrastructure","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing","rating":{"composite":4.16,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 基础设施测试\n\n基础设施即代码将云资源管理从手工操作推进到版本化、可复现的工程实践，但代码化本身并不等于正确性保障。基础设施测试是将软件工程中成熟的验证方法——单元测试、集成测试、端到端验证——系统性地应用于 IaC 工件的学科。它回答的核心问题是：这段基础设施代码部署后是否真的产生了预期行为？\n\n本 hub 聚焦于**验证基础设施代码的方法与工具链**。与同目录下的兄弟 hub 相比，边界如下：\n\n- **infrastructure-as-code**（03）：讲的是如何*编写* IaC（Terraform/OpenTofu/Pulumi 的语法、模块化、状态管理）——本 hub 假设读者已掌握这些，着重讲如何*测试*这些代码。\n- **chaos-engineering**（27）：在生产或准生产环境中注入故障以检验系统韧性——本 hub 关注的是部署*之前*的验证，即 CI/CD 管道中的左移测试。\n- **cloud-security-compliance**（07）：涵盖广泛的安全策略与合规治理——本 hub 仅涉及其中的自动化合规扫描作为测试手段之一。\n\n推荐学习路径（按顺序）：\n\n1. **基础**：测试金字塔与分层策略 → 测试驱动的基础设施 → 环境隔离\n2. **工具**：Terratest/Pulumi 测试 → 策略测试（OPA/Sentinel）→ 容器镜像测试\n3. **集成**：基础设施集成测试 → 网络连通性验证 → 安全合规扫描\n4. **运维**：CI/CD 中的测试编排 → 漂移检测 → 成本预估测试\n\n前置知识：至少一种 IaC 工具（Terraform/OpenTofu 或 Pulumi）的基本使用经验、CI/CD 管道概念、容器基础。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础设施测试基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"testing-pyramid-infra","title":"基础设施测试金字塔","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/foundations/testing-pyramid-infra"},{"seq":2,"slug":"test-driven-infrastructure","title":"测试驱动的基础设施","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/foundations/test-driven-infrastructure"},{"seq":3,"slug":"testing-environments-strategies","title":"测试环境与策略","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/foundations/testing-environments-strategies"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"tools-frameworks","title":"测试工具与框架","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/tools-frameworks","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"terratest-pulumi-testing","title":"Terratest 与 Pulumi 测试","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/tools-frameworks/terratest-pulumi-testing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"policy-testing-opa-sentinel","title":"策略测试（OPA/Sentinel）","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/tools-frameworks/policy-testing-opa-sentinel"},{"seq":3,"slug":"container-image-testing","title":"容器镜像测试","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/tools-frameworks/container-image-testing"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"integration-e2e","title":"集成与端到端测试","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/integration-e2e","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"infrastructure-integration-tests","title":"基础设施集成测试","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/integration-e2e/infrastructure-integration-tests"},{"seq":2,"slug":"network-connectivity-testing","title":"网络连通性测试","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/integration-e2e/network-connectivity-testing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"security-compliance-scanning","title":"安全合规扫描","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/integration-e2e/security-compliance-scanning"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"测试运维与持续保障","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"infra-test-in-pipeline","title":"CI/CD 中的基础设施测试","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/operations/infra-test-in-pipeline"},{"seq":2,"slug":"drift-detection-reconciliation","title":"漂移检测与修复","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/operations/drift-detection-reconciliation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cost-estimation-testing","title":"成本预估与测试","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/operations/cost-estimation-testing"}]}]}